ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945880/extras/e666ab812845f36ebaad8710b5c9742f.poster.avif?t=1740418281\" width=506 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945880/extras/e666ab812845f36ebaad8710b5c9742f.webm?t=1740418281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945880/extras/e666ab812845f36ebaad8710b5c9742f.mp4?t=1740418281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
